       MISSION & VISION: Editorial Services Pattern
       â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• -->
  <Section>
    <Container size="page">
      <div class="about-editorial-header">
        <div class="about-editorial-title-wrap">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Mission & Vision</span>
          <h2 class="about-editorial-heading">Why We Exist & What We're Building</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="about-editorial-desc">
          A clear purpose guiding our work and a vision for an inclusive Finland where international expertise enriches the entire workforce.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-editorial-layout">
        <!-- Mission (Text | Image) -->
        <article class="about-editorial-split">
          <div class="about-split-content">
            <div class="about-service-index-badge">
              <span>Mission</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="about-service-title">Why We Exist</h3>
            <p class="about-service-description">
              Providing a support network and tailored guidance to help international professionals in
              Finland overcome barriers, utilize their skills, and build meaningful careers.
            </p>
            <p class="about-service-subdescription">
              Through diverse programs and services, we assist international professionals qualified for a profession abroad to overcome obstacles hindering them from utilizing their skills in Finland. We provide customized support, mentorship, networking opportunities, and one-on-one guidance as they take career steps toward transitioning into the Finnish workforce.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-split-visual">
            <img
              src="/images/about/mission-visual.webp"
              alt="International professionals receiving guidance and support"
              class="about-split-image"
              width="480"
              height="360"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              onerror="this.src='/images/about/community-2.webp'"
            />
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Vision (Image | Text - Reversed) -->
        <article class="about-editorial-split is-reversed">
          <div class="about-split-content">
            <div class="about-service-index-badge">
              <span>Vision</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="about-service-title">What We're Building Toward</h3>
            <p class="about-service-description">
              An inclusive Finland with a balanced workforce that thrives on both local and
              international expertise.
            </p>
            <p class="about-service-subdescription">
              We envision a future where international professionals seamlessly integrate into Finnish society, contributing their unique skills while the Finnish economy benefits sustainably from the diverse global expertise living here.
            </p>
          </div>
