/* â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
   ABOUT PAGE STYLES - Homepage Pattern
   â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â• */

/* ── Hero: Purpose Manifesto Pattern ── */
.about-purpose-manifesto {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
  gap: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
  align-items: center;
}

.about-purpose-left {
  position: relative;
}

.about-purpose-image-wrap {
  position: relative;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
  overflow: hidden;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  box-shadow:
    0 12px 32px -8px rgba(18, 31, 91, 0.15),
    0 4px 12px -2px rgba(18, 31, 91, 0.08);
}

.about-purpose-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center;
  transition: transform 680ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
}

.about-purpose-image-wrap:hover .about-purpose-img {
  transform: scale(1.04);
}

.about-purpose-right {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-5);
}

.about-purpose-pill {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-2);
  width: fit-content;
  padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
  background-color: rgba(255, 210, 111, 0.12);
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 210, 111, 0.3);
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-primary-700);
}

.pulse-dot {
  display: block;
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  background-color: #ffd26f;
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: pulse 2.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.6, 1) infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse {
  0%,
  100% {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1);
  }
  50% {
    opacity: 0.5;
    transform: scale(1.15);
  }
}

.about-purpose-title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(1.95rem, 3.2vw, 2.75rem);
  font-weight: var(--font-weight-extrabold);
  line-height: 1.14;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  margin: 0;
}

.about-purpose-serif {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular);
  color: var(--color-primary-600);
}

.about-purpose-lead {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.35vw, 1.1875rem);
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  margin: 0;
}

.about-impact-stats-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));
  gap: var(--space-6);
  padding: var(--space-6) 0;
  border-top: 1.5px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
  border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
  margin: var(--space-2) 0;
}

.about-impact-stat {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-1);
}

.about-impact-number {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.5vw, 2.25rem);
  font-weight: var(--font-weight-extrabold);
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--color-primary-600);
}

.about-impact-label {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
}

.about-purpose-subtext {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.96875rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  margin: 0;
}

/* ── Mission & Vision: Editorial Services Pattern ── */
.about-editorial-header {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-4);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
}

.about-editorial-title-wrap {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-3);
}

.about-editorial-heading {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.8vw, 2.35rem);
  font-weight: var(--font-weight-extrabold);
  line-height: 1.16;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  margin: 0;
}

.about-editorial-desc {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  max-width: 68ch;
  margin: 0;
}

.about-editorial-layout {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-16);
}

.about-editorial-split {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
  gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  align-items: center;
}

.about-editorial-split.is-reversed {
  grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;
}

.about-editorial-split.is-reversed .about-split-content {
  order: 2;
}

.about-editorial-split.is-reversed .about-split-visual {
  order: 1;
}

.about-split-content {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-5);
}

.about-service-index-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: fit-content;
  padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
  background-color: var(--color-primary-50);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--color-primary-200);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-primary-700);
}

.about-service-title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2.2vw, 1.85rem);
  font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
  line-height: 1.24;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  margin: 0;
}

.about-service-description {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  margin: 0;
}

.about-service-subdescription {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  margin: 0;
}

.about-split-visual {
  position: relative;
}

.about-split-image {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  box-shadow:
    0 12px 32px -8px rgba(18, 31, 91, 0.12),
    0 4px 12px -2px rgba(18, 31, 91, 0.06);
  transition: transform 580ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
}

.about-editorial-split:hover .about-split-image {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

/* ── Four Pillars Pattern ── */
.about-focus-section-header {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-4);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 800px;
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
}

.about-focus-areas-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: var(--space-8);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
}

.about-focus-card {
  padding: var(--space-8);
  background-color: var(--color-white);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border-default);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  transition:
    transform 280ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
    box-shadow 280ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
    border-color 280ms ease;
}

.about-focus-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow:
    0 16px 48px -12px rgba(18, 31, 91, 0.16),
    0 6px 16px -4px rgba(18, 31, 91, 0.08);
  border-color: var(--color-primary-300);
}

.about-focus-index-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 52px;
  height: 52px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary-500) 0%, var(--color-primary-600) 100%);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--color-white);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
}

.about-focus-title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
  line-height: 1.3;
  letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-4) 0;
}

.about-focus-desc {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  margin: 0;
}

.about-focus-cta-row {
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: var(--space-12);
}

.about-focus-cta-link {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-2);
  padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
  color: var(--color-primary-700);
  background-color: rgba(255, 210, 111, 0.08);
